<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40937" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rējecto</span></b> , āvi, 1,
			v. freq. a.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To throw</i> or <i>cast back</i>
			(very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">montes Icti rejectant voces ad sidera mundi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					2, 328</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Sil. 7, 421</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caseum Alpinum rejectavit,</span>”
				<i>cast up</i>, <i>vomited</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Spart. Anton. 12</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To throw away again</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praedam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					7, 722</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
